25. Sampling

| Method             | Use               | Example               |
| ------------------ | ----------------- | --------------------- |
| `sample()`         | Random rows       | `df.sample(10)`       |
| `sample(frac=...)` | Random percentage | `df.sample(frac=0.2)` |

==

Example:

df.sample(frac=0.1)

means:

Randomly select 10% of the rows.
